-You're three years
into your first term.

00:09:07.546 --> 00:09:09.582
-Yeah.
-You're now applying
for the job again.

00:09:09.582 --> 00:09:11.884
What did you do,
when you became president,

00:09:11.884 --> 00:09:14.186
to restock those cupboards
that you say were bare?

00:09:14.186 --> 00:09:16.021
-Well, I'll be honest, uh...

00:09:16.021 --> 00:09:17.923
I have a lotta things going on.

00:09:17.923 --> 00:09:20.992
-You were playing
with a toy airplane.

00:09:20.992 --> 00:09:22.694
Seriously,
how old are you, really?

00:09:22.694 --> 00:09:23.963
I mean,
'cause your face says 90,

00:09:23.963 --> 00:09:25.498
but your vocabulary says 9.

00:09:25.498 --> 00:09:26.765
It's like body
is aging normally,

00:09:26.765 --> 00:09:28.934
but his brain
is Benjamin Button-ing.

00:09:28.934 --> 00:09:31.637
I mean, experts were warning
about a pandemic for years

00:09:31.637 --> 00:09:34.040
and your big priority was
repainting your airplane.

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:35.274
If Trump weren't president,
he'd be

00:09:35.274 --> 00:09:37.209
the dude airbrushing his van

00:09:37.209 --> 00:09:39.245
down by Daytona Beach
during a hurricane.

00:09:39.245 --> 00:09:41.580
You can just picture him
with a earring and a goatee,

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:43.315
gettin' interviewed
on the local news --

00:09:43.315 --> 00:09:46.485
"Sir, why are you out here
during this deadly storm?!"

00:09:46.485 --> 00:09:49.221
[ As Trump ] Well,
I gotta finish up the van.

00:09:49.221 --> 00:09:51.223
I'm out, you know, puttin'
some privacy beads up

00:09:51.223 --> 00:09:53.358
in the windows
and catch a snooze,

00:09:53.358 --> 00:09:55.360
you know, I'm not selling
my trade goods on the pier.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:56.662
You want a toy airplane?

00:09:56.662 --> 00:09:58.397
It's also a bong.

00:09:58.397 --> 00:10:01.333
And I also would like
that version of him.

00:10:01.333 --> 00:10:04.270
In an alternate life,
I'm a big fan of that guy.

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:06.271
Also, it's not true
that the previous administration

00:10:06.271 --> 00:10:07.440
left the cupboards bare.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.641
You're the one
who repeatedly proposed cuts

00:10:09.641 --> 00:10:12.578
to the budgets of agencies,
like the NIH and CDC,

00:10:12.578 --> 00:10:14.479
shut down the
pandemic planning unit,

00:10:14.479 --> 00:10:17.182
and ignored a briefing
from outgoing Obama officials

00:10:17.182 --> 00:10:18.216
who tried to prepare you

00:10:18.216 --> 00:10:19.884
for exactly this kind
of scenario

00:10:19.884 --> 00:10:21.520
before your inauguration.

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:24.290
Of course, you couldn't attend
that pre-inauguration briefing

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:26.692
because you were too busy,
awkwardly bobbing your head

00:10:26.692 --> 00:10:28.127
during a Three Doors Down
concert,

00:10:28.127 --> 00:10:31.396
like a dad chaperoning his
14-year-old daughter on a date.

00:10:31.396 --> 00:10:34.233
[ As Trump ]
Well! This band is great.

00:10:34.233 --> 00:10:37.603
I guess you could say
they're my Kryptonite.

00:10:37.603 --> 00:10:39.638
Oh, that, by the way,
is a reference

00:10:39.638 --> 00:10:42.274
to a Three Doors Down song,
for those of you under 40.

00:10:42.274 --> 00:10:45.711
No, let's face it -- almost all
of you over 40 as well.

00:10:45.711 --> 00:10:47.913
Trump doesn't care or know
anything about testing

00:10:47.913 --> 00:10:49.648
or contact tracing or pandemics.

00:10:49.648 --> 00:10:52.651
[ Laughing ] He just loves
props and photo ops.

00:10:52.651 --> 00:10:54.320
That's right, another one
of his trademark moves

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:56.756
is dramatically removing a piece
of paper from his coat pocket

00:10:56.756 --> 00:10:58.023
and showing it off to reporters,

00:10:58.023 --> 00:11:00.092
whether it's a letter
from a foreign leader

00:11:00.092 --> 00:11:01.259
or a secret trade deal.

00:11:01.259 --> 00:11:02.561
He's like an old lady
who cuts out

00:11:02.561 --> 00:11:04.062
and mails articles
to her grandkids,

00:11:04.062 --> 00:11:06.164
except he's too cheap
to spring for a stamp.

00:11:06.164 --> 00:11:07.967
At any given time,
he's probably totin' around

00:11:07.967 --> 00:11:09.301
like a week's worth of mail.

00:11:09.301 --> 00:11:11.203
I think he's doing it so,
if he loses in November,

00:11:11.203 --> 00:11:13.172
he can say he has
civil service protections.

00:11:13.172 --> 00:11:14.272
[ As Trump ]
I'm technically a mailman,

00:11:14.272 --> 00:11:16.141
so you can't fire me
without cause.

00:11:16.141 --> 00:11:18.177
And, this week,
Trump has been doing it again.

00:11:18.177 --> 00:11:20.379
Everywhere he goes, he's been
wavin' around a piece of paper

00:11:20.379 --> 00:11:23.148
no one can read, or vet,
to support his claimed

00:11:23.148 --> 00:11:25.784
that he's succeeding in ramping
up testing for coronavirus.

00:11:25.784 --> 00:11:29.421
-These numbers
were just released

00:11:29.421 --> 00:11:31.857
and this is the United States,
the amount of testing

00:11:31.857 --> 00:11:34.392
and our level of testing
and the quality of testing.

00:11:34.392 --> 00:11:35.861
So this is the testing

00:11:35.861 --> 00:11:38.930
and the line here
is the United States.

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:43.335
If we tested as much as these
countries down here, okay?

00:11:43.335 --> 00:11:45.570
Who don't do very much
testing at all,

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:47.105
if I tested this number
of people,

00:11:47.105 --> 00:11:48.541
instead of this
number of people,

00:11:48.541 --> 00:11:50.842
I'd have far fewer --
See this line?

00:11:50.842 --> 00:11:52.043
Goes all the way up.

00:11:52.043 --> 00:11:54.146
Over 7 million tests.

00:11:54.146 --> 00:11:56.515
-No one can see or read
what you're holding.

00:11:56.515 --> 00:11:58.116
Even the anchor can't read it.

00:11:58.116 --> 00:11:59.651
He's sitting more
than 6 feet away from you.

00:11:59.651 --> 00:12:02.387
Of course, he's probably
practicing social distancing.

00:12:02.387 --> 00:12:03.722
Although, it's also possible
that's one

00:12:03.722 --> 00:12:05.224
of the conditions
of Trump's work release.

00:12:05.224 --> 00:12:06.925
"Donald, your probation
requires you

00:12:06.925 --> 00:12:09.562
to stay at least 6 feet away
from everyone, at all times,

00:12:09.562 --> 00:12:11.397
or your ankle monitor
will go off."

00:12:11.397 --> 00:12:12.698
[ As Trump ]
Oh!

00:12:12.698 --> 00:12:15.100
I thought that noise meant
the Totino's were done.

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:16.868
What a double burn for me --

00:12:16.868 --> 00:12:21.406
no pizza rolls and,
I'm violating probation.

00:12:21.406 --> 00:12:23.241
Double bur-r-r-n!

00:12:23.241 --> 00:12:24.476
Of course, in reality,

00:12:24.476 --> 00:12:26.077
wavin' around a piece of paper
means nothing.

00:12:26.077 --> 00:12:28.714
The fact is Trump's deadly
incompetence has made us

00:12:28.714 --> 00:12:30.949
the global epicenter
of the coronavirus outbreak,

00:12:30.949 --> 00:12:33.018
while other major developed
countries have managed

00:12:33.018 --> 00:12:35.187
to suppress the virus
and safely reopen.

00:12:35.187 --> 00:12:37.155
And that failure is also due,
in large part,

00:12:37.155 --> 00:12:38.691
to his translucent son-in-law,

00:12:38.691 --> 00:12:40.425
Jared Kushner,
seen here showing off

00:12:40.425 --> 00:12:43.195
his resting "the dean
will hear about this" face.

00:12:43.195 --> 00:12:44.863
Kushner led a volunteer
task force

00:12:44.863 --> 00:12:46.965
to oversee the White House
coronavirus response

00:12:46.965 --> 00:12:48.333
and, it turns out --
wait for it --

00:12:48.333 --> 00:12:50.002
was amazing
and did an incredible job

00:12:50.002 --> 00:12:51.336
that impressed
public health experts

00:12:51.336 --> 00:12:52.604
across the political spectrum

00:12:52.604 --> 00:12:54.773
and I'm just [bleep] with you.
It was a disaster.

00:12:54.773 --> 00:12:56.441
For example,
the task force was charged

00:12:56.441 --> 00:12:58.511
with securing protective
equipment for hospitals,

00:12:58.511 --> 00:13:00.246
but, according
to The New York Times,

00:13:00.246 --> 00:13:01.947
few of the leads panned out.

00:13:01.947 --> 00:13:03.448
They used personal
Gmail accounts,

00:13:03.448 --> 00:13:06.184
prompting suspicion
from some prospective suppliers

00:13:06.184 --> 00:13:08.521
and brokers who questioned
their bona fides.

00:13:08.521 --> 00:13:09.988
That's right,
they were emailing people

00:13:09.988 --> 00:13:11.390
from personal Gmail accounts,

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:13.258
trying to buy masks
and ventilators.

00:13:13.258 --> 00:13:16.962
It's like they designed these
emails to go directly to spam.

00:13:16.962 --> 00:13:18.663
Did their emails
ask for ventilators

00:13:18.663 --> 00:13:19.898
and also offer suppliers

00:13:19.898 --> 00:13:22.868
to help "meet hot horny
singles in your area"?

00:13:22.868 --> 00:13:24.403
Don't accept the false dichotomy

00:13:24.403 --> 00:13:27.572
between staying locked down
and reopening the economy.

00:13:27.572 --> 00:13:30.209
There's a third option,
where we can safely reopen

00:13:30.209 --> 00:13:32.678
and involves doing exactly
what Trump and his allies

00:13:32.678 --> 00:13:34.646
are doing for themselves --

00:13:34.646 --> 00:13:36.348
widespread testing.

00:13:36.348 --> 00:13:37.883
But Trump and his allies
are only interested

00:13:37.883 --> 00:13:40.118
in protecting themselves,
while they use you

00:13:40.118 --> 00:13:42.721
as cannon fodder
to rev up the economy.

00:13:42.721 --> 00:13:44.723
If you believe Trump,
or his toadies,

00:13:44.723 --> 00:13:47.692
were ever really populace
champions of the working class,

00:13:47.692 --> 00:13:49.461
it's only because
he tricked you.

00:13:49.461 --> 00:13:50.529
I guess you could say he's...

00:13:50.529 --> 00:13:52.197
-Had a mask on
for a period of time.

00:13:52.197 --> 00:13:54.466
-This has been "A Closer" --

00:13:54.466 --> 00:13:55.967
[ Gasp ]

00:13:55.967 --> 00:13:58.369
Instagram it!

00:13:58.369 --> 00:14:00.972
Talkin' to the chair!

00:14:00.972 --> 00:14:03.375
Instagram it!

00:14:03.375 --> 00:14:04.576
This has been "A Closer Look."

00:14:04.576 --> 00:14:08.413
♪♪

00:14:08.413 --> 00:14:10.315
Once again, we're asking you
to help City Harvest.

00:14:10.315 --> 00:14:11.616
You may have donated already,

00:14:11.616 --> 00:14:13.752
but more and more New Yorkers
are turning to them

00:14:13.752 --> 00:14:16.588
to keep food on their tables,
so, please give, if you can.

00:14:16.588 --> 00:14:18.790
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:21.727
Stay safe. Wash your hands.
We love you.

